# Tools of Destruction: settings fields of each placed class, found from the retail levels' class data.
# Same syntax as ACrackInTime.fields (see its header). Offsets are into the class data, which starts with the class number.
# Generated by dev/tools/toddebug/gen.py; hand edits survive only if gen.py is not rerun. Only fields that vary between
# instances, and every reference, are listed.

